      "description": "<p data-start=\"1535\" data-end=\"1569\"><strong data-start=\"1535\" data-end=\"1569\">Le Jazz Primitif From Trinidad</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"1571\" data-end=\"1693\">Rare Caribbean jazz LP featuring Rupert Clemendore and John Buddy Williams on the highly regarded Cook Laboratories label.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1695\" data-end=\"1735\">An excellent addition for collectors of:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1736\" data-end=\"1834\">\n<li data-section-id=\"9ndn3k\" data-start=\"1736\" data-end=\"1752\">\nCaribbean Jazz\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1cwckmj\" data-start=\"1753\" data-end=\"1766\">\nWorld Music\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1luy9zq\" data-start=\"1767\" data-end=\"1792\">\nTrinidad &amp; Tobago Music\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1j2cnpu\" data-start=\"1793\" data-end=\"1815\">\nAudiophile Pressings\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1rju17u\" data-start=\"1816\" data-end=\"1834\">\nVintage Jazz LPs\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1836\" data-end=\"1920\"><strong data-start=\"1836\" data-end=\"1846\">Label:</strong> Cook Laboratories<br data-start=\"1864\" data-end=\"1867\">\n<strong data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"1886\">Catalog Number:</strong> 1082<br data-start=\"1891\" data-end=\"1894\">\n<strong data-start=\"1894\" data-end=\"1905\">Format:</strong> 12\" LP, 33 RPM</p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1uef3h1\" data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"1935\">Condition</h3>\n<p data-start=\"1936\" data-end=\"1965\"><strong data-start=\"1936\" data-end=\"1946\">Vinyl:</strong> VG</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1966\" data-end=\"2036\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1j49r33\" data-start=\"1966\" data-end=\"1980\">\nStrong gloss\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"qj8vxs\" data-start=\"1981\" data-end=\"2006\">\nLight signs of handling\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"xkkpl2\" data-start=\"2007\" data-end=\"2036\">\nNo major scratches observed\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"2038\" data-end=\"2052\"><strong data-start=\"2038\" data-end=\"2049\">Jacket:</strong> VG</p>\n<ul data-start=\"2053\" data-end=\"2128\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1hxe19n\" data-start=\"2053\" data-end=\"2072\">\nModerate age wear\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"9qcvez\" data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2107\">\nSome discoloration and edge wear\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1y6hdst\" data-start=\"2108\" data-end=\"2128\">\nStructurally solid</li></ul>",
